  "id": "foster-care",
  "term": "foster care",
  "definition": "Foster care, in this context, means temporarily caring for an animal from a shelter in a home setting rather than keeping the animal at the shelter. In the study described, this caregiving was linked with companionship, affection, and emotional support for the human caregiver while also supporting animal welfare and shelter life-saving efforts.",
